<title>CANADA: BCE sets preferred shr issue.</title>
<headline>BCE sets preferred shr issue.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BCE Inc said on Monday it agreed to issue 8.0 million 5.28 percent fixed/floating rate preferred shares, series S, to the public.</p>
<p>The offering will be underwritten by a syndicate led by Nesbitt Burns Inc and ScotiaMcLeod Inc. BCE said the offer was expected to close on October 21.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
